"code": "L6",
"title": "ESP32 restarts when the LEDs get bright",
"family": "LED ring",
"kind": "Auto",
"detect": "reset reason plus brightness log",
"body": "**Fix:**\n1. The ESP32 must be powered only by its own USB-C, never by the LED supply.\n2. Check the grounds (N4).\n3. **Settings → LED brightness cap**: lower it.\n4. Check the LED supply is at least 4 A."
